 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Has this changed you? Like, fundamentally? No time to waste.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"The old you got you here. The new you keeps you here. Both count. Gotta keep moving.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I used to be a blacksmith who worried about being on time. Now I worry about being alive. Same worry, bigger font. So yes — and also no.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Still on how this changed you, anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? That's the priority.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"The whole fire was arguing about Murkcap last night — what to even CALL it. 'Don't-Look' got shouted down. What's your vote?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then DeAndre grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "🤝 DeAndre is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I have opinions about the name. I am saving them for when they count.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Did you sleep? I kept hearing things out past the treeline.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "They go still. \"So it's not just me. Good. That's... good to know. Bad, but good.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I sleep in shifts now — two hours, up, listen, two more. My body learned it before my head agreed. Shanghai, China never taught me that. The treeline did.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I… Still on how you slept.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "They glance toward the fire, toward the others — checking who's listening."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "Sofia won't meet your eyes. \"I told myself finders keepers. It wasn't finders keepers. I'm sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "DeAndre nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "You don't answer. The quiet turns pointed."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I should go. Before I overthink this conversation too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Right. Well.\" That's the whole goodbye."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Have you heard what they're calling Murkcap? DeAndre is pushing 'The Ugly Beast'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "Their voice loosens. The guardedness thins."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I'm staying out of the naming fight. For now. Someone always gets precious about their pick.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"We'll land on something. We always do — usually the loudest person's idea.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I should go before I say something sincere.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" DeAndre sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Do you still sing? ...Sorry — weird question. I just realized I haven't heard anyone sing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Ha! The creek concerts. I've heard those. Keep going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Under my breath, when I'm working. Old songs from Columbus, Ohio. The words are half gone but the tune holds. Tunes outlast everything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Quick version — Still on whether you still sing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"Heinrich is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Sofia nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Sofia sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Any regrets? The real kind, not the small stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Quiet. \"Yeah. I think everyone's carrying one of those.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"I regret the ordinary days I rushed through. All those Shanghai, China mornings I spent annoyed at small things. I'd pay anything for one annoyed morning now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Still on your regrets.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Heinrich always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "DeAndre nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"I clean up other people's messes quietly. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "You show them Elderberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about what's been happening — that was 8 days back. Still on your mind? 'A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be.' You'd know about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"My part? I write everything down and stay ready.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You're family now. Chosen family — the kind that actually counts.\" \"That's where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "Sofia nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"What's something from your old life that's actually useful here?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Not dumb at all. The people who can't wait are the ones who make mistakes. You're an asset.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Can I be honest? Being a carpenter taught me to read people fast — who's lying, who's scared, who needs a job. Turns out that's a survival skill. Who knew.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Still on your useful old-life skills.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Hardened The Auction. They just... took Meera and DeAndre. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "DeAndre nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"I save the best bite for last. It passes the time. The time passes anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 21,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  }
 ],
