    "giftSample": [
     "\"Got it,\" Zoe says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\"",
     "🍽️ Grace taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\""
    ],
    "rumorSample": [
     "Esteban showed Zoe the Loquat — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools.",
     "Grace calls the moot. The fire gets built up — word travels fast, and almost everyone comes."
